invariant: INV-14
file: handshake.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the session reports index 0 rather than CH_ALPN_NONE when the
  server sent no ALPN extension, because ch_connect's memset left the
  field at 0 and 0 is the first protocol the caller offered. RFC 7301
  §3.2 lets a server that does not support ALPN send none, so a caller
  would read the silence as a selection of its first preference.
  bin/webpki_session_test's absent-extension row objects.

--- old
    t->alpn_selected = CH_ALPN_NONE;
--- new
    t->alpn_selected = 0;
